  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_7293.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>92 fotos de l&#39;&uacute;ltim dia de bous a les festes d&#39;estiu de Suera, d&#39;aquest dissabte 16 d&#39;agost, amb la prova de vesprada i embolada de nit de Trist&oacute;n, marcat amb el n&uacute;mero 16, guarisme 1, de la ramaderia Antonio Fern&aacute;ndez. Molt d&#39;ambient, a pesar de l&#39;amena&ccedil;a de pluja.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefestesagostsuera14/img_7064.jpg\" alt=\"img_7064\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefestesagostsuera14/img_7066.jpg\" alt=\"img_7066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefestesagostsuera14/img_7067.jpg\" alt=\"img_7067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefestesagostsuera14/img_7068.jpg\" alt=\"img_7068\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefestesagostsuera14/img_7069.jpg\" alt=\"img_7069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefestesagostsuera14/img_7070.jpg\" alt=\"img_7070\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefestesagostsuera14/img_7071.jpg\" alt=\"img_7071\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefestesagostsuera14/img_7072.jpg\" alt=\"img_7072\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439